{"id":"0c460759287fa783","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Pruned Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree — ZFC Tree8 Pruned Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree — ZFC Tree8 Pruned Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree — ZFC Tree8 Pruned Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R\\in V\">\\(T,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T^2:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,R)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;(s\\subsetneq t)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T^2:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,R)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;(s\\subsetneq t)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The inclusion order is explicitly restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^2\">\\(T^2\\)</span>.  Prunedness then says exactly that no node is terminal in this set-coded tree order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-tree]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S(T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T^2:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,R)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;(s\\subsetneq t)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T^2","display":false}],"bytes":946,"backlinks":[{"id":"028c35c6c49fa960","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree.md]]）"},{"id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8PrunedTree}_S$ (pruned-tree predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3816","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-pruned-tree]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f06e57c5c0b1354d"]}